  "selection": "Gateway catalogues fetched 2026-10-21. General text models created since 2026-04-21 inclusive. Snapshot aliases deduplicated; audio, realtime, image and embeddings excluded. OpenAI and Anthropic only as requested. chat-latest is a rolling alias.",
  "pricingSources": [
    "https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing",
    "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing"
  ],
  "pricing": "Standard public rates, no gateway surcharge per user. Reserve all input at highest published cache-write price, all output including reasoning. Anthropic cache creation/read tokens added to fresh input. No explicit prompt caching requested. Errors retain full reservation, never retried automatically. Estimates, not invoices.",
  "ordering": "Attempt rounds 1..5, then matched seed, then interleaved provider models and paired modes, reverse model/mode ordering on even rounds. Six concurrent independent episodes. Stop before reservation would exceed $100.",
  "interface": "Identical prompts, physical space, client validation and two repairs. Anthropic unsupported numerical/length schema constraints moved to descriptions and checked client-side. Native adaptive thinking medium/low. OpenAI medium/low except Pro medium/medium and Instant chat-latest default. Equal output caps, not equal compute.",
  "memory": "Fresh requests only. No-notes equals fresh target, current visible milk and parameter guide. Both arms reflect; control discards reflection. Notes carries its own latest replacement note only. No SDK memory, conversation IDs or previous response IDs. Gateway-side memory/routing not independently observable.",
  "optimizer": "Reuse first five evaluations of frozen v0.7 CMA-ES seeds 42,43,44; identical source hashes, task, conditions and generic initialization. No reference warm start. Mark as cached baseline.",
  "limits": "Heart only; practice milk schedules; no held-out shape/milk evaluation. Three seeds is exploratory, not a significance claim. Measures context adaptation, not weight training. Numerical passes can have a weak notch."
